  "content": "<pre style=\"text-align:center\">這個由MCowners簽署的模組簡單新增了<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">手電筒</span>、<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">頭燈</span>和<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">提燈</span></pre>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">你需要從1.19.2版本開始<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tct-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">安裝TCTcore</a>&nbsp;</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tct-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1060479/description_8c92719e-4bbe-4f5b-8f8e-1525626ab452.png\" width=\"198\" height=\"198\"></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4f3dcfec-9fcb-4347-98b8-57a0d3881c94.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">手電筒</span>會隨時間消耗電池電力，只需在物品欄備有電池即可自動充電</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1f50b1ff-6fde-4545-9757-1faf61490154.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6648a1c0-e3d0-4131-93b7-68f27fd68d65.gif\" width=\"324\" height=\"182\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6dd2c9e7-b5ce-4764-a19b-0b4570d03351.gif\" width=\"322\" height=\"181\"></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">頭燈</span>運作原理與手電筒相同，但照明距離較短且耗電更快，同樣可透過電池自動充電</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7a85bcf1-891c-43bc-b8d4-22350fa5fa7c.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">提燈</span>製作成本較低，但照明效果不如其他物品</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#f1c40f;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d961e77c-80f3-496c-a6f0-75e7f50fc697.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">以下是合成配方</h1>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_db4a8c56-b1cd-441d-a7da-20ae7fc93729.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4c98fb27-448e-462f-b794-374196ba0ddb.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_57c169bf-fd5b-43b5-8600-a9b943388c9f.png\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b8a50c59-6909-4f73-808a-3d9e51df8552.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
